cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the ERA5 CrocoDash extension or workflow, please cite this
  software and the upstream CrocoDash software.
title: ERA5 Atmospheric Forcing Extension for CrocoDash and Regional MOM6
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Faezeh
    family-names: Maghsoodifar
    affiliation: The University of Alabama
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-01
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - ERA5
  - CrocoDash
  - MOM6
  - CESM
  - CDEPS
  - regional ocean modeling
  - atmospheric forcing
  - hurricane storm surge
abstract: >-
  A reusable CrocoDash extension and NCAR workflow that preprocesses eight
  ERA5 atmospheric fields and supplies them through the CDEPS JRA interface
  to regional MOM6 cases. The included Hurricane Ike example demonstrates a
  full ERA5-forced 21-day Gulf of Mexico simulation.
